adAt":"2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"1129529","title":"The Next Passage (Alternamorphs, #2)","author":"K.A. Applegate","url":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8985575730?utm_medium=api&utm_source=rss","coverUrl":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1375604644l/1129529._SX98_.jpg","rating":2,"readAt":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"42397849","title":"Burnout: The Secret to Unlocking the Stress Cycle","author":"Emily Nagoski","url":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8930830253?utm_medium=api&utm_source=rss","coverUrl":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1551216612l/42397849._SX98_.jpg","rating":2,"readAt":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"}]},"mastodonPosts":[{"id":"117654974391311926","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117654974391311926","createdAt":"2026-11-21T14:47:16.391Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Dot-Man finally has a mailing list! I realize I should have set this up earlier, but it’s the best way to find out when it will be available on Steam. <a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/GameDev\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>GameDev</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://dot-man.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span>dot-man.com</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117654974294249123","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/654/974/294/249/123/original/c9737144a7ceae02.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/654/974/294/249/123/small/c9737144a7ceae02.jpg","description":"Dot-Man logo"}]},{"id":"117639488459802858","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117639488459802858","createdAt":"2026-11-18T21:08:59.833Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>We had a great <a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/RubyBridgesWalkToSchoolDay\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>RubyBridgesWalkToSchoolDay</span></a> today with some kids from school. Hearing 7 year-olds grapple with the idea of not being able to go to their school is always so hard and fulfilling.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/parenting\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>parenting</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117639488359446925","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/639/488/359/446/925/original/e85890228b335d15.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/639/488/359/446/925/small/e85890228b335d15.jpg","description":"Talking about Ruby Bridges with the kids before walking"}]},{"id":"117635517948092624","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117635517948092624","createdAt":"2026-11-18T04:19:14.629Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Definitely enjoying that shield upgrades can let you kinda bully the ghosts chasing you in Dot-Man now that I got the bounce-back functioning the way that feels best.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/GameDev\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>GameDev</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117635517174423302","type":"gifv","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/635/517/174/423/302/original/ee55a24f0c15f78b.mp4","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/635/517/174/423/302/small/ee55a24f0c15f78b.png","description":"Dot-Man bouncing ghosts away after going down a stream."}]},{"id":"117610104217151986","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117610104217151986","createdAt":"2026-11-13T16:36:11.872Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Watched A Few Good Men. M\u0010asterpiece of the early 90s, there are a lot of beautiful things Reiner did with the Navy/Marines dichotomy that I hadn’t intellectually noticed before. Sorkin writing is magical and each small part is played so well that it brings things to life.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/MovieReview\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>MovieReview</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117610104104302655","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/610/104/104/302/655/original/bbc6a406cbe39950.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/610/104/104/302/655/small/bbc6a406cbe39950.jpg","description":"Cruise and Moore sitting at a desk"}]},{"id":"117595877865941781","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117595877865941781","createdAt":"2026-11-11T04:18:14.976Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>After really struggling with the hard parts of <a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/GameDev\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>GameDev</span></a> (marketing) over the past week, it was delightful to toss together a game in an evening with a kiddo from his mock-ups.</p>","media":[{"id":"117595877813200421","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/595/877/813/200/421/original/d6120ea6014ca881.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/595/877/813/200/421/small/d6120ea6014ca881.jpg","description":"A white surface holds a hand-drawn rectangle. Inside the rectangle, handwritten words read, 'creator Milo, co-creator mark, Ideas by milo and Emma.' Below the rectangle, the word 'back' is written."}]}]},"__N_SSG":true}